ealing Basic Attack DMG gives Brant 15% Basic Attack DMG Bonus for 10s.","params":["15%","10"]},{"index":6,"name":"All the World's a Captain's Carnevale","description":"Mid-air Attack's DMG Multiplier is increased by 30%. Casting Returned from Ashes causes a secondary blast, dealing Fusion DMG equal to 30% of the DMG dealt by Returned from Ashes, considered Basic Attack DMG.","params":["30%","30%"]}],"model":"basic","provenance":{"source":"encore","sourceId":"character/1206.json","verified":true}}
